Error [E0914]: unknown interpolation selector `#Repr`
  --> tests/ui/debug_unknown_selector.jet:3:15
    |
  3 |     print("{x#Repr}")
    |               ^^^^
 Why: string interpolation supports a closed selector set — use `#Debug` for debug output
 Fix: write `{value#Debug}` for debug formatting, or `{value}` for display
